The community has voted for the idea of SIREN; now we must get into the details and work out how exactly SIREN is built; 
・we will use the first two months to develop an architecture and plan the execution of the project.
・we will examine if there are legal roadblocks for SIREN; after all, we will create a public blacklist for wallets, and we expect pushback from certain actors. As it stands right now, we do not need regulatory approval. However, we will still conduct the legal analysis so the community can rest assured that things are done correctly.
